:: Gabe Hang Out End Late High Fun [nobr]

/* Intro */
You find yourself sitting next to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> telling him a story of something that may or may not be true that happened to you at school. He sits next to you with a smirk that you can’t tell is one of being impressed or of not buying a single word you are saying. <span style="color:LightGreen">Still, it is a fun conversation and one of those brotherly bonding moments that you are bound to remember for years to come.</span> Sadly, it comes to an end as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> yawns and checks his phone. <br>

        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Happy",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

<span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Damn, it’s getting pretty late. I should probably be getting you home. Don’t want little bro to be late to his bedtime, else he’ll get all cranky.”</span> He says in a teasing voice. You roll your eyes and punch him lightly in the shoulder, telling him you have no bedtime. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Oh, I’m sure it isn’t just because Dad hasn’t caught your ass.”</span> You both laugh and stand up, stretching your arms out as <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> mentions for you to get moving, as the big brother he has to walk you home. <br>
<br>


<div id="choice">
	<<link "Ask for a piggyback ride<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        As <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> starts to walk away, you grab him by the sleeve and stop him in his tracks. He turns around with a curious expression to see you standing there, shy smile on your face, as you ask if he wouldn’t mind giving you a lift. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“A lift?”</span> He raises his eyebrow before realizing what you mean, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Yeah, no thanks. You can walk.”</span> But- but your feet are tired! <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“That’s your own fault.”</span> But if he did you would get home faster! <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Uh-huh.”</span> Fine, you guess he’s just not strong enough… <br>
        <br>
        <span style="color:LightGreen">That gets him to stop.</span> <br>
        <br>
        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Alright, if you’re going to be a little baby about it.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> relents, bending down so you can get on his back, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But this isn’t going to become a thing!”</span> <span style="color:Pink">You happily dash over and get on <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s back for a cute piggyback ride home.</span> <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
            State: {
                Mouth: "Happy",
                Blush: 1,
                },
            },
            {
            Name: "Gabe",
            State: {
                Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
                Mouth: "Smirk",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        You have to admit, it feels a little bit embarrassing to be walking through town on your brother’s back, but you are having too much fun to care. In fact, it’s so comfortable that you feel you may even be able to fall asleep there. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>, however, has other ideas. Once you get onto your street, he laughs and asks if you want to see how fast he can go. <span style="color:LightGreen">Without waiting for your response, he takes off at top speed!</span> <br>
        <br>
        You have to hold on as tight as you can to not risk falling off and being left as a heap on the sidewalk… <span style="color:LightGreen">It was pretty fun though. Even if you feel a little sick as he deposits you onto the couch.</span> <br>
        <br>
