    <</link>>
	<<link "Walk and talk<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You run to catch up next to <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> and begin to walk alongside him, chatting about the various things you’ve done today and the other things you’d like to do in the future. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“We should go camping sometime. Remember that time dad took us? Or wait, did you come with or stay with a friend?”</span> You answer <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span>’s question and agree that camping could be fun. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“But maybe we should try it without dad or Noah, that way I can bully you and you can’t go crying to anyone.”</span> He laughs, obviously teasing you, though the idea sticks in your head. <br>
        
        <<set _ad to [
            {
            Name: "Player",
