                Mouth: "Smirk",
                },
            },
        ]>>
        <<ad _ad>>

        <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Hey, remember that one time. Fuck, how old were you? Pretty sure Noah was still a baby, so you were pretty little. Anyways, remember how-”</span> <span style="color:LightGreen">The rest of the walk home is full of stories from your life that you’ve thought of hundreds of times before, for better or worse, but hearing them from <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Gabe</span> and how happy he seems recalling them makes you smile. It’s a nice moment.</span> <br>
